"安全原则" = "Our ground rules";
"只接受合法、善意、安全的请求。平台禁止发布危险活动、侵犯他人隐私、商业推销或违反法律法规的内容。所有公开内容都要经过人工审核后才会展示。" = "Only lawful, well-meant, safe requests. No dangerous activities, no invading anyone's privacy, no advertising, nothing illegal. Everything public is reviewed by a person before it's shown.";
"举报与屏蔽" = "Reporting and blocking";
"在任何一段私聊里点右上角「⋯」，可以举报对方或直接屏蔽。举报后我们会人工查看该会话并处理，通常在 24 小时内响应。屏蔽是立即生效的，不需要等待审核：屏蔽后双方都无法再在那段对话里发消息，但对话与历史记录会保留，你也可以随时取消屏蔽。你还可以发邮件到 hansel.zzh@gmail.com 举报。" = "Tap ⋯ in the top corner of any conversation to report or block. Reports are read by a person, usually within 24 hours. Blocking takes effect immediately, with no waiting: neither of you can send messages in that conversation any more, but the conversation and its history stay, and you can unblock at any time. You can also report by email to hansel.zzh@gmail.com.";
"隐私声明" = "About your privacy";
"我们不向你索取微信或手机号。沟通与交付都在应用内完成，你和对方都看不到彼此的联系方式。公开的心愿与故事只显示城市和地标，不含精确位置。" = "We never ask for your phone number or WeChat. Everything happens in the app, and neither of you sees the other's contact details. Public wishes and stories show only the city and the place — never an exact location.";
"常见问题" = "Common questions";
"提交心愿后多久能完成？" = "How long does a wish take?";
"心愿提交后会先进行安全审核，再依据城市与地标匹配附近愿意帮忙的人。" = "It's reviewed for safety first, then shown to people near that city and place who might be willing to help.";
"响应者没有按时完成怎么办？" = "What if my helper doesn't follow through?";
"可以先在私聊里直接沟通。若对方长时间没有回应，你可以重新选择其他帮助者；遇到骚扰或不当行为，请在私聊里举报。" = "Start by messaging them. If they go quiet for a long time, you can choose someone else. If anything is harassing or inappropriate, report it from the conversation.";
"交付的文件格式是什么？" = "What can they send me?";
"帮助者可以提交一段文字和最多 9 个照片或视频。内容只对你可见；是否公开到首页由你单独决定，且需要经过人工审核。" = "A note plus up to 9 photos or videos. Only you can see it. Whether it ever becomes public is your call alone, and it's reviewed first.";
"哈喽卧得（Gratia）隐私政策与服务条款" = "Gratia Privacy Policy and Terms of Service";
"最后更新：2026-08-03" = "Last updated: 3 August 2026";
"条款与协议" = "Terms and policies";
"信息收集" = "What we collect";
"我们仅在发布或响应心愿时收集称呼、联系方式，以及城市、地标和文字、图片、视频等内容，用于人工审核、匹配、派单与交付。联系方式从不出现在任何公开页面。" = "When you post or answer a wish we collect the name and contact details you give, along with the city, place, and any text, photos, or video — used for review, matching, assignment, and delivery. Contact details never appear on any public page.";
"登录信息" = "Sign-in information";
"使用 Sign in with Apple 登录时，我们只接收 Apple 提供的匿名用户标识，用于识别你的账户。我们不请求、不接收、不保存你的姓名和邮箱。" = "With Sign in with Apple we receive only the anonymous identifier Apple provides, used to recognise your account. We never request, receive, or store your name or email.";
"系统权限" = "System permissions";
"仅在你主动点击「保存到相册」时申请相册的「仅添加」权限，用于保存你收到的交付照片。该权限在技术上无法读取你相册中的既有内容。本版本不申请定位、通讯录、相机或麦克风。" = "We ask for add-only access to your photo library, and only when you tap Save to Photos. That permission cannot read anything already in your library. This version never asks for location, contacts, camera, or microphone.";
"信息共享" = "Sharing";
"未经明示同意，我们不会向无关第三方披露你的真实身份或联系方式。我们不含广告或分析 SDK，不做跨应用追踪，也不会出售你的数据。" = "We don't disclose your identity or contact details to unrelated third parties without your explicit consent. There are no ad or analytics SDKs, no cross-app tracking, and we don't sell your data.";
"数据存储" = "Storage";
"订单和交付文件由受控服务保存，交付访问链接不在公开页面展示或长期保存。登录凭据只保存在本机钥匙串，不同步到 iCloud。" = "Records and delivery files are kept on controlled services. Delivery links are never shown on public pages or kept long-term. Sign-in credentials stay in this device's keychain and are not synced to iCloud.";
"费用说明" = "Costs";
"本应用完全免费，不涉及任何金额。App 内没有支付、没有应用内购买、没有任何形式的收费或金额申报，也不收集任何支付信息。响应者是自愿提供帮助的个人。" = "Gratia is free and involves no money at all. There are no payments, no in-app purchases, no charges of any kind, and we collect no payment information. Helpers are individuals volunteering their time.";
"你的权利" = "Your rights";
"你可以随时在「我的 → 账户」中退出登录或删除账户。删除后登录身份会被清除、所有会话立即失效，已有记录中的称呼与联系方式会被匿名化；为完成中的履约与审计，去标识后的订单记录会保留。删除不可撤销。" = "You can sign out or delete your account at any time under You → Account. Deleting removes your sign-in identity, ends all sessions immediately, and anonymises the names and contact details in existing records. De-identified records are kept for in-flight commitments and auditing. Deletion cannot be undone.";
"服务性质" = "What this service is";
"本平台是信息撮合平台，不是劳务派遣或代购服务商。响应者是自愿提供帮助的个人，不是平台员工。心愿的实际完成结果由响应者本人负责，平台负责审核、撮合、跟进与争议协调。" = "Gratia connects people; it is not a staffing agency or a shopping service. Helpers are individuals volunteering, not our employees. What actually gets done is down to the helper; we handle review, matching, follow-up, and disputes.";

